WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the Get involved film. The words are the voice-over script as NBCC supplied it.
Each caption starts with its speech, measured from the film's own sound, and ends a moment after it.

1
00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:03.630
Got an idea that could
raise money for NBCC?

2
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:08.040
Good. Because fundraising for NBCC
just got easier.

3
00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.410
A sponsored walk.

4
00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.400
A bake sale. A quiz night.

5
00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.160
Whatever you have in mind.

6
00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:17.300
Raise money your way,
and we will help.

7
00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:20.950
With your own page, posters,
a bucket, and more.

8
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:25.140
Start at nbcc.scot/get-involved.

9
00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.070
It takes a few minutes.

10
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.620
Tell us what you're planning.

11
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:30.350
Give it a name.

12
00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:33.510
Set a target, if you'd like one.

13
00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:34.800
Say what would help.

14
00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.850
Check it, and send it.

15
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.200
Putting on an event?
We can list it.

16
00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:41.150
You can even ask us along.

17
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:44.790
A real person reads every sign up,
and gets in touch.

18
00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:47.740
Once it's a yes, your page is live.

19
00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:50.380
Share it.

20
00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.200
Print your QR code.

21
00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.930
And watch it add up.

22
00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:59.150
It all helps children, young people
and vulnerable adults

23
00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.920
across South West Scotland.

24
00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:02.680
So. Got an idea?

25
00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:04.100
Let's make it happen.

26
00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:07.370
nbcc.scot/get-involved

27
00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:10.460
NBCC. Here all year.
